Z||000000||AkursedX||07-21-2001||08:32 PM||||I am utterly disgusted with my car.....For the past 3 weeks, my car has given me nothing but trouble.  It started with my coil going out and leaving me stranded.  That wasn't too bad of a problem.  I just went home and got my backup coil and it was fixed.<P>Then about a week and a half later, on my trip to the Michigan show I end up collasping a lifter.  But I manage to make it home at least, but I still have to take almost the entire top end apart.  <P>Well, yesterday, I got everything back together, and this morning I filled it up with antifreeze, and tried to start it.  It didn't want to start.  I ended up having to fiddle with the distributor for 2 hours to get it to run right.  But it finally started up and was running good, except for one thing.<P>I bought a low temp fan switch from Rodney Dickman, and I installed it, but my fan wouldn't kick in at all.  I fiddled around with the switch and did everything I could, but it would engage the fan.  <P>So I go and take out the fan switch and put my old one back in.  This would of been the last thing I would've had to do besides putting the decklid back on.  Well, I must have cross-threaded it or something, because I end up cracking the hole that the fan switch is supposed to go in to.  I started it up (I didn't know I cracked it at the time)  And I start leaking coolant everywhere!  Then I look and see the damage and damn near burst into tears...........<P>The car is all apart again (took me about 2 hours this time around)  and now I'm waiting for a new intake.  <P>Needless to say, I have had a very stressful week because of that stupid car.  All I can think about right now is getting it back together.  I just want to get this done as soon as possible.  I am so sick and tired of even looking in the engine bay.  <P>I was contemplating selling this car after if failed on me on my trip to Michigan.  Now I even have more of a reason to do it.......<P>On a positive note, for the time it was running, it sounded great.  At least I know the lifter problem is fixed.  <P>Well thank you all for listening.  I think I am going to get hammered tonight.<P>------------------<BR><BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/sigpic2_2.jpg"> ||||reg||9
